{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"d16796cd98fb4131","type":"group","x":-240,"y":-240,"width":1120,"height":940,"color":"4","label":"MOURNINGDEW Phenomina"},
		{
			"id":"5e5c33bd535c4c3a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"This is the same first video from the lake prior to PENNY's creation.\n(See Kris -> The Lake for more).\nInterestingly; the fact the game could be played again after; in spite of DELTARUNE being deprecated, may imply that MOURNINGDEW is localized to the device it's currently contained within, as opposed to *entirely* getting rid of DELTARUNE.\n...A happy ending to Kris' story may be possible; with that in mind?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":220,
			"y":-220,
			"width":640,
			"height":180,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"d3e912f4fbecf3d3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"Collective comment: \"This is the genesis of MOURNINGDEW, it seems. The anonymous source which provided this video noted that the only modification made to the game was a personal one adding lyrics to the Secret Boss's fight. Additionally, after Kris splits off from the cutscene, no player input was provided. They seemingly moved on their own. Nothing more exists; the game was closed and re-installed shortly after. No further anomalies occurred after such.\"",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":220,
			"y":360,
			"width":640,
			"height":180,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{"id":"5bf6a34b27fa58c7","type":"link","url":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ZdRdNIbP-Wg","x":220,"y":-20,"width":640,"height":360,"color":"4"},
		{
			"id":"e89bcf7b4faf14ae",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"This canvas' placement in the 'Outside The Device' folder is primarily speculative at the moment.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-220,
			"y":-220,
			"width":420,
			"height":80,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"d39e4aaffa12ee88",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"From [their Youtube Account](https://www.youtube.com/@mourningdew-phenomena):\n\nWe are documenting the MOURNINGDEW phenomena. Anonymous sources have provided the information on this channel. We (nor, seemingly it) are not associated with DELTARUNE or any fan project. Uploads will be done as chronologically as we can manage.\n\n*First channel description.*",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-220,
			"y":-130,
			"width":420,
			"height":260,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{
			"id":"ab91b396b54749cb",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"northernblight reference?",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-130,
			"y":160,
			"width":240,
			"height":60,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{"id":"86c9c30483a3f0a7","type":"file","file":"Conspiracy Board/Events/Media/Outside The Device/CH5 Secret Boss Lyrics.png","x":-220,"y":260,"width":400,"height":319,"color":"4"},
		{
			"id":"9850a5390f2dc3df",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"I cross-referenced the lyrics, they are the normal Mew Mew Magic lyrics. What isn't normal, however, is...\nThat's a head. Here's a reconstructed version, though it's very strangely upscaled verse whatever it's original resolution was.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":220,
			"y":560,
			"width":480,
			"height":120,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{"id":"127b3c80863a3421","type":"file","file":"Conspiracy Board/Events/Media/Outside The Device/Head_Reconstructed.png","x":740,"y":549,"width":62,"height":60,"color":"1"}
	],
